### Bug ID:
BUG-6  

### Title:
Editing a created food card is not possible

### Environment:
- Browser: Google Chrome 120
- OS: Windows 10
- Version: Demo / Test

### Preconditions:
- User is logged in

### Steps to Reproduce:
1. Click on the Edit button on a Food card.
2. Fill all fields with data.
3. Click on the Edit button to save changes.

### Expected Result:
- The user is redirected to the Home page for logged users.
- The changes on the Food card are saved and displayed.

### Actual Result:
- The Edit button on the Edit Food page does not work; changes are not saved.

### Severity:
High

### Priority:
High

### Status:
New
